# Line endings that must not be rewritten.
#
# The repository is developed on Windows, where `core.autocrlf=true` is usually
# set. That silently rewrites a `.sh` to CRLF in the working copy, and bash then
# fails with `\r: command not found` or a bad-interpreter error the first time
# anyone runs it — which, for scripts/build-ios-ipa.sh, means the iOS build
# breaks on a checkout rather than on a change.
#
# It is one line, and it is the difference between a script that works on the
# machine that owns it and one that only works in CI.
*.sh text eol=lf
